<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>关节空间 ↔ 笛卡尔空间：一次双向翻译</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M1 · 核心概念</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 682, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={650} height={420} viewBox='0 0 650 420'>
                <rect x='14' y='60' width='248' height='160' rx='10' fill='#E8EFF8' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' />
                <text x='138' y='112' textAnchor='middle' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='26' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>关节空间</text>
                <text x='138' y='152' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='19' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>(θ₁, θ₂, …, θ₆)</text>
                <text x='138' y='188' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>电机的“命令”</text>
                <rect x='388' y='60' width='248' height='160' rx='10' fill='#E8EFF8' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='2' />
                <text x='512' y='112' textAnchor='middle' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='26' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>笛卡尔空间</text>
                <text x='512' y='152' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='19' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>(x, y, z)</text>
                <text x='512' y='188' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>我们的“目标”</text>
                <line x1='272' y1='112' x2='378' y2='112' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='3' />
                <polygon points='378,112 362,104 362,120' fill='#1E4FA8' />
                <text x='325' y='98' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='17' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>FK</text>
                <line x1='378' y1='164' x2='272' y2='164' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='3' />
                <polygon points='272,164 288,156 288,172' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                <text x='325' y='196' textAnchor='middle' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='17' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>IK</text>
                <line x1='40' y1='272' x2='610' y2='272' stroke='#E8EFF8' strokeWidth='2' />
                <text x='325' y='304' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>两个空间之间，只有这一次双向翻译 —— 它就是运动学的全部内容</text>
                <rect x='40' y='336' width='270' height='60' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E8EFF8' strokeWidth='1' />
                <text x='175' y='362' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>FK：一定有唯一答案</text>
                <text x='175' y='384' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>好算</text>
                <rect x='340' y='336' width='270' height='60' rx='6' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#E8EFF8' strokeWidth='1' />
                <text x='475' y='362' textAnchor='middle' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>IK：可能多解 / 可能无解</text>
                <text x='475' y='384' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>难算</text>
            </svg>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', padding: 22, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>谁在用哪个空间？</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.78, lineHeight: 1.75 }}>电机与伺服驱动器只听得懂<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>角度</span>；而我们人只会说“把手放到桌子上面”。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.78, lineHeight: 1.75 }}>运动学就是这两种语言之间的翻译官。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 118, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 22, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>为什么 FK 好算、IK 难算？</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.78, lineHeight: 1.7 }}>FK 是“顺着走”：角度唯一决定位置。<br />IK 是“倒着找”：同一个位置常常有好几组关节角都到得了。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 1 章 · M1　机械臂怎么“知道”手在哪？</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>05 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
